Now I'm awake.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.328
hRRmlfdbLgh...

00:19:02.633 --> 00:19:04.157
I can't sleep.

00:19:10.575 --> 00:19:14.067
That haggard face...
It seems you have some dilemma.

00:19:14.912 --> 00:19:17.779
I just didn't get much sleep, thanks to Tomo.

00:19:18.449 --> 00:19:19.951
I shan't let you go!

00:19:19.951 --> 00:19:22.120
Do not hold back.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:26.921
Why not speak to ME, the Savior
of St. Mihailov Academy, Madam Lilly?

00:19:28.926 --> 00:19:30.461
JUST COME WITH ME!

00:19:30.461 --> 00:19:32.053
Huh?

00:19:33.731 --> 00:19:35.800
I get it.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.668
You're completely deserted.

00:19:37.668 --> 00:19:39.437
Looks like everyone's kinda over it.

00:19:39.437 --> 00:19:43.271
That's right. And after all that exuberance...

00:19:43.808 --> 00:19:46.709
How I miss the days of long lines.

00:19:47.278 --> 00:19:50.247
Why not add some tea or cake
to your fortune-tellings?

00:19:50.648 --> 00:19:53.651
I considered that, but...

00:19:53.651 --> 00:19:56.449
I felt I would be lowering myself somehow.

00:19:57.355 --> 00:20:00.324
There's no way anyone would think that.

00:20:00.992 --> 00:20:05.053
I'm sure if they could get to eat cake,
they'd be like, "Lucky!" wouldn't they?

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:07.761
Do you think so?

00:20:08.366 --> 00:20:09.333
Yes!

00:20:17.375 --> 00:20:21.243
Thank you, Mafuyu. You've been such a help!

00:20:24.982 --> 00:20:27.576
Oh, my. That's our 20-minute consultation.

00:20:28.119 --> 00:20:29.887
This shall be your cost.

00:20:29.887 --> 00:20:32.185
YOU'RE the one who got a consultation!

00:20:33.224 --> 00:20:34.792
Breasty-breast.

00:20:34.792 --> 00:20:35.417
Oink, oink!

00:20:36.794 --> 00:20:38.696
Now then, Question 8!

00:20:38.696 --> 00:20:43.861
Which of the so-called "farm animals"
has an ancestor still in existence?

00:20:44.669 --> 00:20:45.636
Three, two, one.

00:20:45.636 --> 00:20:47.505
Oink! Oink, oink!
Three, two, one.

00:20:47.505 --> 00:20:48.301
Three, two, one.

00:20:51.676 --> 00:20:52.870
The answer is...

00:20:53.144 --> 00:20:55.479
Pigs! Pigs! Friggin' pigs!

00:20:55.479 --> 00:20:57.915
The ancestor of the pig is the wild boar!

00:20:57.915 --> 00:21:00.218
Remember that. It's the pig.

00:21:00.218 --> 00:21:01.480
Oink, oink!

00:21:04.388 --> 00:21:07.380
Ma'am! Th-Those were some amazing angles.

00:21:08.826 --> 00:21:11.192
Shut up about the angles!

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:15.191
Stop!

00:21:18.069 --> 00:21:20.204
< Okay then, everyone! >

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.564
Bye-bye!

00:21:26.877 --> 00:21:28.572
Do you have a point card?

00:21:28.846 --> 00:21:29.835
No, I don't!

00:21:48.466 --> 00:21:54.905
Yuraida, hitaishou no kidou

00:21:54.905 --> 00:22:01.412
Jokyoku ni kazashita kousai

00:22:01.412 --> 00:22:07.652
Hikari no shuushisen wa hizunda mama

00:22:07.652 --> 00:22:13.249
Kashika sareta yume o kataru

00:22:15.126 --> 00:22:20.498
Yuuan na kyokou no shin'en ni

00:22:20.498 --> 00:22:26.604
Itsuka torawareta sekai o uchinuke

00:22:26.604 --> 00:22:28.572
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:28.572 --> 00:22:30.241
And you will die in your sin

00:22:30.241 --> 00:22:33.444
Juuji o kire, fuzai no kami ni

00:22:33.444 --> 00:22:37.081
Kakusei no uta o kanadeshi koe wa

00:22:37.081 --> 00:22:39.917
Boutoku no tsurugi ka?

00:22:39.917 --> 00:22:41.485
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:41.485 --> 00:22:43.154
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:43.154 --> 00:22:46.891
Shadan sareta kimi to no oratorio

00:22:46.891 --> 00:22:49.794
Aisetsu o tsuki ga terashite

00:22:49.794 --> 00:22:55.391
Aoku kagayaku asu e no eve

00:23:10.014 --> 00:23:10.948
Return Bin

00:23:10.948 --> 00:23:10.981
Next Episode

00:23:10.981 --> 00:23:11.682
What?!

00:23:11.682 --> 00:23:13.651
A mandatory stay at Chichigashira Hot Springs?

00:23:13.651 --> 00:23:15.386
Big Ma'am is an idiot, isn't she?

00:23:15.386 --> 00:23:18.322
Don't insult Ma'am!
Still, I can't deny that statement.

00:23:18.322 --> 00:23:22.293
Everything that woman does
is too extreme! I'm boycotting it.

00:23:22.293 --> 00:23:26.627
If you can. Ma'am would chase you
to the depths, to the lowest rung of hell.

00:23:27.398 --> 00:23:28.466
Next time on Qwaser of Stigmata II,

00:23:28.466 --> 00:23:32.336
Night of the Communal Hot Spring 2
- I Was Surprised When I Sucked It-

00:23:32.336 --> 00:23:34.805
Tremble! Kneel down in fear!
